  "prefLabel": "Bea 602.36 Vacant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 602.36 “Vacant” means a property that is empty of all personal property generally required for habitation and which has been unoccupied for 90 days.\n\nSource. #14044, eff 8-8-24",
